  "einstModellLoeschen": "Delete model",
  "einstModellNichtGeladen": "{beschreibung}\n\nThe model this needs is not downloaded yet.",
  "einstVokabularText": "Terms the image search model (CLIP) applies automatically to newly imported photos. Changes here only affect future photos – to apply them to the existing library, see Tools → “Compute AI tags” → “All photos”.",
  "einstBegriffHinzufuegenFeld": "Add a term …",
  "einstBegriffHinzufuegen": "Add term",
  "einstOrteText": "Turns a photo's GPS position into country, state or province and city – entirely locally, via the nearest known city (GeoNames data), without asking an online map service. Needed for the country, state and city filters in the search options.",
  "einstGeoTitel": "GeoNames – cities, countries, states",
  "einstGeoText": "Cities from 1000 inhabitants worldwide (~10 MB). Licence: {lizenz}.",
  "einstGeoLoeschen": "Delete the GeoNames data",
  "einstGesperrtText": "Encrypts private photos with AES-256 – real encryption, not just a display filter – and hides them everywhere else (timeline, search, albums, people, map, backup). Without the PIN there is no way back.",
  "einstGesperrtEntsperrt": "PIN set up – already unlocked for this session.",
  "einstGesperrtOeffnen": "Open",
  "einstPinAendern": "Change PIN",
  "einstGesperrtAufloesenText": "Every photo in the locked folder is decrypted and becomes visible again everywhere (timeline, search, albums, people, map, backup). This cannot be undone.",
  "einstBackupVerschluesselungTitel": "Backup encryption",
  "einstBackupVerschluesselungText": "Lets you encrypt manual and automatic backups with AES-256. Its own passphrase, separate from the locked folder's PIN – a backup often ends up elsewhere and has to be decryptable without this machine.",
  "einstBackupEntsperrt": "Set up – already unlocked for this session.",
  "einstBackupGesperrt": "Set up – you will be asked at the next backup.",
  "einstBackupAendern": "Change",
