  "werkzGesichterScannenTitel": "Scan for faces",
  "werkzGesichterScannenFrage": "New photos only: quick, and skips photos that have already been scanned.\n\nScan all photos again: goes through the whole library afresh – worth doing after an update to face detection, for instance, or to work out closed-eye detection for photos scanned earlier. On a large library it takes correspondingly longer. Faces you assigned by hand are kept.",
  "werkzNurNeueFotos": "New photos only",
  "werkzAlleErneutScannen": "Scan all again",
  "werkzScanneNeue": "Scanning new photos …",
  "werkzScanneAlle": "Scanning all photos again …",
  "werkzVorschauNeuTitel": "Rebuild previews",
  "werkzVorschauNeuFrage": "Missing only: handles just those photos and videos that currently have no thumbnail – HEIC photos imported before native image conversion was set up, say, or videos imported before video thumbnails existed.\n\nRebuild all: creates new thumbnails and previews for the whole library, which is worth doing after an update to image or video conversion. On a large library it takes correspondingly longer.",
  "werkzNurFehlende": "Missing only",
  "werkzAlleNeuErstellen": "Rebuild all",
