  "werkzAlleHabenEmbedding": "Every photo already has an embedding.",
  "werkzKiTagsTitel": "Compute AI tags",
  "werkzKiTagsFrage": "Untagged photos only: quick, and skips photos that already carry at least one tag, whether set by hand or automatically.\n\nAll photos: goes through the whole library afresh and adds fitting AI tags to already tagged photos as well. Existing tags are kept.",
  "werkzNurUngetaggte": "Untagged only",
